WEBVTT

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:56.390
Was Godai a good teacher?

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:01.090
I wish you'd
stay for dinner--

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:04.430
Well, Grampa's waiting.

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:06.730
Okay.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:10.710
You're right.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.650
Stop it, Soichiro!
That's enough!

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.540
Honestly!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:20.050
Soichiro!

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.880
Auntie Kyoko?
Can I walk him?

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.720
I want to walk Soichiro!

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:33.160
Are you sure?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.760
It'll be okay!

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.170
All right.
But be careful.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.200
Let's go, Soichiro!

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:47.150
Soichiro, get down!

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.210
Bad dog! Bad Soichiro!

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:05.600
I've got the bell pepper,
and pork loin--

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.130
I know I'm
forgetting something.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.000
Soichiro!

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.850
Soichiro!

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.510
Soichiro!

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.300
Careful on the way home.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.130
See ya later, Soichiro.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:46.830
B'bye!

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:48.740
See ya later!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.380
Say hello to your
father for me.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:52.730
Sure!

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.810
--Take care.
--Catch you next time.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:04.860
Soichiro.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.930
Where's he from?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.560
He's been following me
since I got our yakitori!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.490
He's so dirty.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.700
Must be starving.
Here you go, Shiro.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.630
"Shiro"?

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:21.000
I just call him that
because he's white.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.710
Hey! That's enough!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:26.540
Stop it!
That's OUR dinner!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.810
I said "no"!
Down, Shiro!

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.360
"Shiro"? "Shiro"?

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:40.930
"Shiro"?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.360
Manager!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:43.500
Yes?

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.530
Hello, Kentaro.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.600
So who's this "Shiro"?

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.170
"Shiro" is the name of--

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:55.810
Stop!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.100
Running errands today?

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:01.210
Yes.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.050
I can walk him home.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.150
I guess--

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.920
Okay, thank you!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.290
Just leave him to me.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:25.430
Evey now and again,
you feel the passage of time.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:38.250
Suddenly, you realize you've
become a part of your town.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.690
Hello there!

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:43.710
How was the butcher shop?

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.520
They had a special on pork.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:48.930
I'd better hurry, then.
Come on, Sweetie, we're going.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.270
Bye-bye!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:51.830
Bye-bye!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.200
Sweetie, watch where you're going!

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:05.280
The day I became manager and
first entered Maison Ikkoku

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:07.340
seems like a lifetime ago.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:30.520
That's that.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:31.830
Manager!

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.970
Has Soichiro come back?

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:42.380
'Cause he--
He got away.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.820
"Got away..."?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.490
Just as we were crossin'
the train tracks--

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:08.240
S-Soichiro!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.210
After the train went by,
I looked everywhere.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.880
It was the
yakitori he wanted.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.330
I'll go look
for him again.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.800
Don't worry. I'm sure
he'll be right back.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:26.700
But--

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.230
Don't worry!

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.760
Soichiro is a tough cookie.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.760
So, Soichiro...

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.810
...is on the lam.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.800
What'm I gonna do if
he doesn't come home?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.700
Have faith.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:53.220
His homing instinct
is intact.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.180
But--

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:58.880
Sure, his
homing instinct.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.850
By the way, what's a homing instinct?

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.000
A moment, please.

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:05.800
Here.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:07.030
Whazzat?

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.370
A dictionary.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:10.730
I can see that!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:13.330
What'm I supposed
to be doin' with it?

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:17.500
I doubt my explanations
could make you understand.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.140
W-Wait--

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.090
You don't have
to run away--

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.000
Hey! Can I ask
you guys something?

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:46.860
Whaddya want?

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:51.260
Have you seen a really big,
white, dumb dog around?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.830
What for?

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.060
Whaddya want?

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.870
Ain't seen nothin'!

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.210
You haven't?

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.200
Thanks anyway.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:21.760
Soichir--

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.100
Taro!

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.430
Taro!

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.760
Kentaro.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:59.270
He's really worried.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:05.750
Listen. Your name
is Shiro. Shiro!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:07.470
Shiro!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.520
Soichiro, dinner's ready.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:12.240
Okay!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:42.310
Gee, I wonder if Soichiro
really is "mangy."

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.750
"Wizened," maybe...

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.620
...or, "slightly weathered."

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:59.600
In any case, he's hardly
what you'd call "young."

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:05.400
You stupid dog.
No will power.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.300
I sense danger.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:44.870
A very clear
and present danger.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.410
What's dangerous?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.710
You--

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.450
--You should treat me to dinner.
--Git!!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.160
Must you be
so heartless?

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:08.470
Less heartless than a thief who
extorts food from a poor student.

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.370
I was only
thinking of Soichiro.

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:13.490
Explain the relationship.

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:18.610
Obserrve, he's been gone for five days!
Have you heard this saying...

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:23.970
Three days a master;
a master for life.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:28.120
You don't forget your
life's master in three days.

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:32.890
Speaking hypothetically, what
if someone else lays claim?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.020
He might abide there, in
betrayal of the manager.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:39.720
See the danger?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:45.240
That's ridiculous! The manager
loves him! He has a duty!

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.770
We are talking
about a dog here.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.410
Is that rain I hear?

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.280
Is it mangy enough?

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.760
It bears a certain resemblance.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.650
She ought to be
givin' up soon.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:44.130
She'll settle on this guy.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.390
I doubt it.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:46.570
Why not?

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:52.170
She's not looking for a white dog.
She's looking for Soichiro.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.280
Ain't no replacin' that.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:06.890
Wandering white dog;
I must ask, ''Where for art thou;
My Soichiro?''

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:11.090
Akemi, you'd better start
callin' around the neighborhood.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:14.330
Find a home for that dog.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:18.100
I guess I'll take it
back to the shelter.

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:24.600
Speaking of shelters,
have you checked them all?

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.570
Soichiro is in no shelter.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:30.440
And there have been
no reports of accidents.

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.070
And furthermore--

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.400
This is for SALE!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.250
I was speaking.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:38.480
So where'd he run off to?

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.290
You DO!?

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:48.830
Didja really see him!?

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:52.660
You're lookin' for a big,
white dog, right?

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:54.160
Kinda slow--

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:56.460
With real long hair--

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:58.770
And droopy ears--

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.030
Eyes poppin' out--

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.130
And fat--

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:04.610
Short legs--

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:06.070
Kinda dumb--

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.570
Really dumb--

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.810
He's at my house.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.350
Just a minute

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.630
Finally, huh?

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:56.550
Finally.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.460
I thought we'd never find him.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.900
Good job.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.370
I'm so worried!

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.940
I-It'll be okay.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:17.280
It can't be the wrong dog, can it?

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.550
We described him perfectly,
and she agreed to everything!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.960
There can't be two
dogs in the world like him!

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:23.790
Right?

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:28.990
I-I guess you're right.

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:30.420
Yoko, where're you going?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.390
Be right back!

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:33.400
H-Here she comes!

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.430
W-Where're you going!?

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.900
I-I was gonna go
tell the Manager--

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:41.640
Don't be stupid!
I'm not doing this alone!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:42.700
See?

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:44.110
This is the dog, right?

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.740
Soichiro--

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.420
Isn't he cute?

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:18.740
Kyoko?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.350
What will you
do from now on?

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.010
Shiro... ?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:08.190
What are you doing?
Are you looking for Soichiro?

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.240
He won't be coming back.

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.100
Never.

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.900
Never again.

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.210
Oh, Soichiro--

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.110
Cheer up.

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:06.790
Let's keep looking.

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:11.120
I'll look over this way.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.220
Okay.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:27.910
Maybe we'll never--

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:30.010
I think we should
call him "Spike"!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:31.900
We should call
him "Fluffy"!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:32.670
Mom!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.800
Will you two be quiet!

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.050
A mangy dog like that--
"Stupid" is a better name.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:40.080
Call him "Stupid."
Stupid, dinner's ready.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.280
Soichiro!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.990
S-Soichiro.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:02.030
So--

00:22:10.420 --> 00:22:12.580
G-Godai?

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:17.710
Well? Go!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.290
Soichiro.

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:54.010
Godai and I are registered at
a sports fair at Kentaro's school.

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:57.750
But Kentaro really wants
his father and mo--

00:23:57.820 --> 00:23:58.800
Kentaro has a father?

00:23:59.490 --> 00:24:03.620
Next: "Even Kyoko's Surprised!
'I'm Kentaro's Father.'"

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.480
So Mrs. Ichinose
has a husband.
